@startuml
actor Guest
participant FE
participant JobSvc
database DB


Guest -> FE : Nhập từ khóa + Enter
FE -> JobSvc : search(keyword, page)
JobSvc -> DB : SELECT jobs WHERE title/company/desc LIKE keyword
DB --> JobSvc : rows + total
JobSvc --> FE : results(page)
FE --> Guest : Danh sách + phân trang
@enduml